. 
. * ============================
. * Analysis
. * ============================
. 
. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H3 * 
. 
.         * We run an IV regression with timediff as the dependent variable and
>  anydaughter as the independent variable, with anydaughter being instrumtende
> d by firstbornisdaughter.
.         * Controls are male_age, female_age, male_age2, female_age2, male_mig
> backdummy, female_migbackdummy, and syear fixed effects.
. 
.         ivreg2 timediff male_age female_age male_age2 female_age2 male_migbac
> kdummy female_migbackdummy i.syear (anydaughter = firstbornisdaughter), clust
> er(hid) 

